# Publish the generated site and nothing else.
#
# Ignore everything at the top level, then re-include only docs/ — the folder
# GitHub Pages serves straight from the branch. The authoring sources, the build
# script, the textbook PDFs, the released exams and the project notes all stay
# on this machine.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/docs/

# --- local tooling, ignored even inside the folders above ------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
